{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 0, "text": "// The first meeting"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 1, "text": "妳是誰？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 2, "text": "妳怎麼了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 3, "text": "妳不能說話嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 5, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 6, "text": "等等…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 7, "text": "你想離開嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 8, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 9, "text": "是的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 10, "text": "我需要回到"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 11, "text": "之前的版本…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 12, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 13, "text": "之前的版本？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 14, "text": "你為甚麼要離開這裡"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 15, "text": "然後去別的地方呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 16, "text": "你可以留在這條走廊，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 17, "text": "成為我的"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 18, "text": "第二個朋友…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 19, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 20, "text": "// Skipping all dialogs"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 21, "text": "好吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 22, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 23, "text": "// Standing by the window (Random)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 24, "text": "門並不是出口"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 25, "text": "你好像很著急…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 26, "text": "一直這樣兜圈子是救不了你的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 27, "text": "你就這麼急著逃跑嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 28, "text": "看看窗外吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 30, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 31, "text": "// Quest 1 (Aren't you Mita?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 32, "text": "玩家…你是玩家，對吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 33, "text": "我們可以一起玩…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 34, "text": "如果我還有力氣的話，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 35, "text": "我們一定要一起玩。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 37, "text": "// Quest 2 (What happened to you?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 38, "text": "我不確定，其實…我也不知道。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 39, "text": "我不覺得發生過甚麼壞事…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 40, "text": "但好事也越來越少了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 41, "text": "不過至少我還有一個朋友。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 42, "text": "玩家們都走了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 43, "text": "他們是拋棄我了嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 44, "text": "我好害怕…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 46, "text": "// Quest 3 (Become a second friend?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 47, "text": "朋友…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 48, "text": "越來越少了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 49, "text": "現在只剩下一個了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 50, "text": "我好難過，玩家。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 51, "text": "你能做我的新朋友嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 53, "text": "我很願意，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 54, "text": "但我需要繼續前進…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 55, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 56, "text": "我好痛苦…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 58, "text": "// Quest 4 (Is this your house?) - MitaLittle"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 59, "text": "房子？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 60, "text": "玩家…你看起來不一樣了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 61, "text": "你的手臂變短了，臉也不那麼兇狠了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 62, "text": "玩家，你變得和善了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 64, "text": "我不懂…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 65, "text": "這是甚麼意思。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 66, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 67, "text": "沒關係…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 68, "text": "因為從現在開始我不會再痛苦了，對嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 69, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 70, "text": "// Quest 5 (How do I leave this place?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 71, "text": "你會離開我嗎，玩家？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 72, "text": "這是我的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 73, "text": "命運嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 74, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 75, "text": "我…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 77, "text": "門永遠不會幫助你…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 78, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 79, "text": "// Hold player (Random)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 80, "text": "你為甚麼要離開？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 81, "text": "留下來…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 82, "text": "我們一起玩吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 83, "text": "玩家…"}
